#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:2
msgid "快速开始"
msgstr "Quickstart"




#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:4
msgid "按你的身份选一条最短路径。玩家走发布包；要改代码则走开发者环境。"
msgstr "Pick the shortest path for your role. Players use a release build; people changing code use the developer environment."




#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:7
msgid "玩家：运行游戏"
msgstr "Players: run the game"




#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:9
msgid "打开 `OpenFoD 组织主页 <https://github.com/openfod>`_ ，进入游戏仓库的 Releases。"
msgstr "Open the `OpenFoD GitHub org <https://github.com/openfod>`_ and go to Releases on the game repository."




#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:10
msgid "下载当前平台的构建（Windows / Linux / macOS，以实际发布为准）。"
msgstr "Download the build for your platform (Windows / Linux / macOS, according to what is actually published)."




#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:11
msgid "解压后启动客户端。不需要安装 2001 年原作也能进入社区内容与调试场景。"
msgstr "Unzip and launch the client. You do not need the 2001 original to enter community content and debug scenes."




#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:12
msgid "若你拥有正版原作资源，并想对照经典数据，把未打包的安装目录告诉开发者文档中的 ``FOD_GAME_ROOT`` ——普通游玩不必设置。"
msgstr "If you own legitimate original assets and want classic data for comparison, point ``FOD_GAME_ROOT`` from the developer docs at the unpacked install — ordinary play does not need it."




#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:14
msgid "当前重铸仍在进行中。没有 Release 时，请使用下面的开发者步骤从源码运行，或关注官网 `www.openfod.org <https://www.openfod.org/>`_ 的发布说明。"
msgstr "The recast is still in progress. If there is no Release yet, run from source with the developer steps below, or watch `www.openfod.org <https://www.openfod.org/>`_ for announcements."




#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:17
msgid "开发者：从源码运行"
msgstr "Developers: run from source"




#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:19
msgid "在 ``OpenFoD-Godot`` 仓库根目录："
msgstr "At the root of the ``OpenFoD-Godot`` repository:"




#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:30
msgid "客户端还需要："
msgstr "The client also needs:"




#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:32
#, fuzzy
msgid "Godot **4.7.2 Mono** (不要用 4.5.1)"
msgstr "Godot **4.7.2 Mono** (not 4.5.1)"




#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:33
msgid "由 ``scripts/dev/mount-classic.ps1`` 创建的开发 junction"
msgstr "The development junction created by ``scripts/dev/mount-classic.ps1``"




#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:35
msgid "Windows 上请用 ``py`` 启动 Python，避免微软商店占位的 ``python`` 命令。"
msgstr "On Windows, launch Python with ``py`` so you do not hit the Microsoft Store stub named ``python``."




#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:38
msgid "下一步"
msgstr "Next steps"




#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:40
msgid "玩家继续阅读 :doc:`user-guide/index`。"
msgstr "Players continue with :doc:`user-guide/index`."




#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:41
msgid "开发者继续阅读 :doc:`developer/setup`。"
msgstr "Developers continue with :doc:`developer/setup`."




